  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seaweed Value Chain Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: The project is in the SME fisheries processing sector..Beneficiaries: Directly and indirectly more than 1,000 people mostly from marginalized fishing communities in Zanzibar and Kilwa in Tanzania mainland..Description: The grant will bolster the seaweed value chain by increasing the capacity of HSCL to increase the purchase of seaweed from farmers and therefore increasingly boost their incomes. The company will increase the range and volume of products being processed from seaweed. Local and export earnings are expected to significantly in the next 4 years as a result of USADF grant.</narrative>
  </description>
